---
const portraitSrc = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/rustice-vincent-portrait.webp`;
---

<section id="about" class="page-width pt-36 pb-20 md:pt-44 md:pb-28">
  <div class="max-w-4xl">
    <div class="hero-identity">
      <div class="hero-title-block">
        <p class="section-kicker">Information Technology Student</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
          Hi, I'm <span class="shiny-sec">Rustice Vincent Caldeo.</span>
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-portrait-frame">
        <img
          class="hero-portrait"
          src={portraitSrc}
          alt="Professional portrait of Rustice Vincent Caldeo wearing glasses and a dark suit"
          width="1254"
          height="1254"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg md:text-2xl leading-relaxed text-[var(--white-icon)]">
      IT student with an interest in software development, databases, and practical technology projects.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="#projects" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--sec)] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[#17121f] transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-[#bd9aff]">
        Explore my projects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#contact" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--line)] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--white)] transition hover:border-[var(--sec)] hover:bg-[#a476ff12]">
        Get in touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 border-t border-[var(--line)] pt-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.3fr] md:gap-16">
    <div>
      <p class="section-kicker">About Me</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-.04em]">Curious about technology. Focused on learning by building.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="section-copy space-y-4">
      <p>
        I am an Information Technology student at Filamer Christian University with an interest in software development, database management, and technology. I enjoy exploring different areas of IT and developing projects that combine functionality, creativity, and practical problem-solving.
      </p>
      <p>
        Throughout my academic journey, I have gained experience working with programming languages, web development technologies, and database systems through academic and personal projects. I also enjoy learning new tools and technologies that help me improve my technical abilities and understanding of software development.
      </p>
      <p>
        As I continue to develop my skills, I aim to gain more hands-on experience, take on new challenges, and grow into a capable IT professional.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-identity {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) clamp(6.75rem, 21vw, 11.5rem);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  .hero-title-block { min-width: 0; }

  .hero-title {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 6.5vw, 5.6rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -.065em;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  .hero-portrait-frame {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    padding: 4px;
    border: 1px solid #c3a4ff;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #c4a6ff, #604487 70%, #2b2337);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 7px #a476ff16, 0 18px 48px #00000045;
  }

  .hero-portrait {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 38%;
    background: #25212b;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero-identity {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 6.5rem;
      gap: .85rem;
    }

    .hero-title { font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 8vw, 2.45rem); }
    .hero-title-block .section-kicker { font-size: .58rem; letter-spacing: .12em; }
    .hero-portrait-frame { padding: 3px; }
  }
</style>
